preferred-citation:
  type: software
  title: "TokemFX Trading Bot"
  abstract: |
    A comprehensive, production-ready forex trading system built with Python,
    featuring advanced architecture patterns for scalability and maintainability.

    Key Features:
    - Event-driven architecture for component decoupling
    - Factory patterns for extensible broker/strategy creation
    - Comprehensive risk management system
    - Multi-layer caching (Redis, SQLite, CSV)
    - Real-time monitoring with Prometheus metrics
    - Configurable trading strategies with Backtrader
    - WebSocket integration for live data feeds
    - Professional deployment with Docker-compose
  repository-code: "https://github.com/your-org/tokemfx-bot"
